  "_comment": "Authorized public sources for the news-context lane (src/context-refresh.js, docs/NEWS_CONTEXT.md). kind: rss|atom. bodies: true = the linked article's public HTML may be fetched and up to three short passages stored as evidence; false = headline-only leads (paywalled, or the publisher's terms do not allow body retrieval). verified is written by the live refresh run (last HTTP status + item count), never by hand \u2014 a source is unverified until a run in GitHub Actions has fetched it. Add a source here; nothing else reads URLs.",
